' Change 1662: #option StartupMethodsDisabled with the program's own #startup sub.
' Expected (build 1662): ";!  call MYSTART" in the asm and no MYSTART routine (it is not called). Build 1661 compiled
' MYSTART although it was never called.
#chip 18F46J50, 48
#option explicit
#option StartupMethodsDisabled
#startup MyStart

Dir PORTB Out
Do
    PORTB = PORTB + 1
    Wait 100 ms
Loop

Sub MyStart
    PORTB = 0x55
End Sub
